      <p>All prices below were pulled from <a href="https://cloudblast.io/pricing" class="text-orange-400 hover:underline">cloudblast.io/pricing</a> on August 19, 2026 (HTTP 200, page size 721 KB). Prices are listed in EUR with both hourly and monthly billing. The promotional LEB21 SKU that LowEndBox featured at €4.03/mo is a discounted version of VMA21 in the standard table.</p>

